\sup_{\lambda \in [0,1]} \Big\| &  \lambda[\hat{v}^X_j(\cdot,\lambda) - v^X_j(t)] - \frac{m\lambda}{\lfloor m \lambda \rfloor} R_{i,m}(t,\lambda)\Big\| \\
