\Big\|\sum_{k \neq i} \frac{\langle \lambda G_{j,m}(\cdot,\lambda),v^X_k \rangle}{\tau^X_j - \tau^X_k}  v^X_k(\cdot)\Big\| &= \Big( \sum_{k \neq i} \frac{\langle \lambda G_{j,m}(\cdot,\lambda),v^X_k \rangle^2}{(\tau^X_j - \tau^X_k)^2}   \Big)^{1/2} \\
